<section aria-label="Focus timer">
  <h2>{$pomodoroLabel} · {$pomodoroMinutes} minutes</h2>
  <p>{time:countdown $pomodoroEnd, units=2, live, past='Interval complete'/}</p>
  <p><a href="?examples/time/pomodoro&amp;minutes=25">Start a 25-minute focus interval</a> · <a href="?examples/time/pomodoro&amp;minutes=5">Start a 5-minute break</a></p>
  <p>Each start creates a new interval. The countdown remains readable without JavaScript; reload to refresh it.</p>
</section>
